---
// Sliding window log: every timestamp is kept; only those in the last 10 s count.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 400 200" width="100%" role="img" aria-labelledby="rl-sl-t rl-sl-d">
  <title id="rl-sl-t">A sliding window log</title>
  <desc id="rl-sl-d">
    A timeline of request timestamps. A shaded band covers the last 10 seconds, ending now. Seven
    timestamps fall inside the band and count against a limit of 10, so three more requests are
    allowed. Older timestamps to the left of the band are deleted.
  </desc>

  <text x="200" y="28" font-size="19" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">7 in the last 10 s: room for 3</text>

  <!-- The sliding window: 9.5 s to 19.5 s on a 0-20 s axis, 18 units per second -->
  <rect x="191" y="50" width="180" height="76" rx="4" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft)" />
  <line x1="191" y1="50" x2="191" y2="126" stroke-width="1.5" style="stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <line x1="371" y1="50" x2="371" y2="126" stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />

  <!-- Old timestamps: hollow, about to be deleted -->
  <g fill="none" stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-muted)">
    <circle cx="58" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="83" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="110" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="150" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="182" cy="104" r="6" />
  </g>
  <!-- Timestamps inside the window -->
  <g style="fill: var(--viz-flow)">
    <circle cx="225" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="236" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="268" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="299" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="310" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="342" cy="104" r="6" />
    <circle cx="362" cy="104" r="6" />
  </g>

  <line x1="20" y1="126" x2="380" y2="126" stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-stroke)" />
  <g font-size="19" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">
    <text x="20" y="154">older: deleted</text>
    <text x="196" y="154">now − 10 s</text>
    <text x="380" y="154" text-anchor="end">now</text>
  </g>
  <text x="200" y="190" font-size="19" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">The band slides right as time passes.</text>
</svg>
